{"page":295,"width":1778,"height":2614,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8.3 교착 상태 특성","words":[{"text":"8.3","x":1214,"y":147,"width":55,"height":23},{"text":"교착","x":1285,"y":146,"width":47,"height":27},{"text":"상태","x":1340,"y":146,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"특성","x":1395,"y":146,"width":47,"height":27}]},{"text":"8.2.1 라이브라 Live10ck","words":[{"text":"8.2.1","x":303,"y":281,"width":115,"height":30},{"text":"라이브라","x":465,"y":280,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"Live10ck","x":613,"y":288,"width":117,"height":22}]},{"text":"353","words":[{"text":"353","x":1515,"y":142,"width":60,"height":29}]},{"text":"8.3","words":[{"text":"8.3","x":179,"y":1762,"width":88,"height":36}]},{"text":"라이브락(livelock)은 또 다른 형태의 라이브니스 장애이다. 그것은 교착 상태와 유사하","words":[{"text":"라이브락(livelock)은","x":304,"y":354,"width":326,"height":39},{"text":"또","x":643,"y":357,"width":31,"height":27},{"text":"다른","x":687,"y":353,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"형태의","x":762,"y":354,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"라이브니스","x":866,"y":353,"width":153,"height":38},{"text":"장애이다.","x":1031,"y":353,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"그것은","x":1179,"y":353,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":1290,"y":353,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"상태와","x":1367,"y":353,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"유사하","x":1478,"y":352,"width":101,"height":38}]},{"text":"다; 둘 다 두 개 이상의 스레드가 진행되는 것을 방해하지만 진행할 수 없는 이유가 서로","words":[{"text":"다;","x":304,"y":413,"width":41,"height":37},{"text":"둘","x":360,"y":416,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"다","x":408,"y":415,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":454,"y":417,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"개","x":502,"y":415,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"이상의","x":548,"y":415,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"스레드가","x":656,"y":414,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"진행되는","x":794,"y":415,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":928,"y":414,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"방해하지만","x":1000,"y":414,"width":157,"height":37},{"text":"진행할","x":1170,"y":414,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1278,"y":414,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"없는","x":1326,"y":414,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"이유가","x":1402,"y":414,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"서로","x":1513,"y":414,"width":65,"height":37}]},{"text":"다르다. 교착 상태가 어떤 스레드 집합의 모든 스레드가 같은 집합에 속한 다른 스레드","words":[{"text":"다르다.","x":304,"y":473,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":432,"y":475,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":514,"y":475,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"어떤","x":629,"y":475,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"스레드","x":704,"y":475,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"집합의","x":814,"y":475,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":916,"y":476,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"스레드가","x":992,"y":475,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":1131,"y":475,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"집합에","x":1209,"y":475,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"속한","x":1319,"y":475,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1400,"y":476,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"스레드","x":1479,"y":476,"width":99,"height":36}]},{"text":"에 의해서만 발생할 수 있는 이벤트를 기다리면서 봉쇄되면 발생하는 반면에, 라이브락","words":[{"text":"에","x":304,"y":533,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"의해서만","x":353,"y":534,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"발생할","x":504,"y":535,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":616,"y":536,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":665,"y":536,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"이벤트를","x":741,"y":536,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"기다리면서","x":877,"y":535,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"봉쇄되면","x":1042,"y":536,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"발생하는","x":1182,"y":536,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"반면에,","x":1326,"y":536,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"라이브락","x":1448,"y":537,"width":130,"height":37}]},{"text":"은 스레드가 실패한 행동-을 계속해서 시도할 때 발생한다. 라이브락은 두 사람이 복도를","words":[{"text":"은","x":302,"y":594,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"스레드가","x":350,"y":594,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"실패한","x":503,"y":595,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"행동-을","x":615,"y":595,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"계속해서","x":724,"y":596,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"시도할","x":859,"y":595,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":963,"y":595,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"발생한다.","x":1005,"y":596,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"라이브락은","x":1151,"y":596,"width":160,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":1322,"y":598,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"사람이","x":1368,"y":597,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"복도를","x":1478,"y":598,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"지나가려고 할 때 가끔 발생하는 현상과 유사하다. 한 사람은 오른쪽으로 움직이고 다른","words":[{"text":"지나가려고","x":304,"y":654,"width":171,"height":36},{"text":"할","x":488,"y":655,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"때","x":537,"y":655,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"가끔","x":582,"y":655,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"발생하는","x":659,"y":656,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"현상과","x":799,"y":656,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"유사하다.","x":902,"y":656,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":1045,"y":656,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"사람은","x":1088,"y":657,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"오른쪽으로","x":1194,"y":658,"width":161,"height":34},{"text":"움직이고","x":1367,"y":658,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1512,"y":659,"width":66,"height":36}]},{"text":"한 사람은 왼쪽으로 움직이면서 여전히 서로의 진행을 방해한다. 그런 다음 한 사람은","words":[{"text":"한","x":303,"y":715,"width":35,"height":34},{"text":"사람은","x":353,"y":715,"width":105,"height":36},{"text":"왼쪽으로","x":475,"y":716,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"움직이면서","x":623,"y":715,"width":156,"height":37},{"text":"여전히","x":800,"y":716,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"서로의","x":906,"y":716,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"진행을","x":1014,"y":716,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"방해한다.","x":1120,"y":717,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"그런","x":1270,"y":718,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"다음","x":1350,"y":719,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":1430,"y":719,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"사람은","x":1478,"y":719,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"왼쪽으로 이동하고 다른 한 사람은 오른쪽으로 움직인다. 봉쇄되지는 않았지만 앞으로","words":[{"text":"왼쪽으로","x":304,"y":775,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"이동하고","x":459,"y":776,"width":132,"