text":"pthread-mutex-trylock()을","x":302,"y":1019,"width":498,"height":39},{"text":"사용하도록","x":813,"y":1019,"width":157,"height":37},{"text":"그림","x":982,"y":1019,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"8.1의","x":1056,"y":1019,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"예제를","x":1145,"y":1020,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"다시","x":1251,"y":1021,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"작성한다.","x":1327,"y":1021,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"스레드","x":1478,"y":1022,"width":101,"height":34}]},{"text":"1이 first-mutex를 획득한 후 thread-two가 second-mutex를 획득하면 이 상황은","words":[{"text":"1이","x":305,"y":1080,"width":49,"height":35},{"text":"first-mutex를","x":371,"y":1082,"width":259,"height":33},{"text":"획득한","x":643,"y":1080,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"후","x":752,"y":1081,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"thread-two가","x":797,"y":1080,"width":219,"height":36},{"text":"second-mutex를","x":1029,"y":1082,"width":253,"height":34},{"text":"획득하면","x":1295,"y":1082,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1435,"y":1082,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"상황은","x":1478,"y":1082,"width":102,"height":36}]},{"text":"라이브락으로 이어질 수 있다. 그런 다음 각 스레드는 pthread-mutex-trylock()을","words":[{"text":"라이브락으로","x":305,"y":1140,"width":205,"height":36},{"text":"이어질","x":526,"y":1141,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":638,"y":1141,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":688,"y":1141,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"그런","x":773,"y":1141,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"다음","x":851,"y":1141,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":927,"y":1141,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"스레드는","x":970,"y":1141,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"pthread-mutex-trylock()을","x":1106,"y":1143,"width":474,"height":39}]},{"text":"호출하여 실패하고, 각자의 락을 해제한 후 동일한 행동을 무한정 반복한다.","words":[{"text":"호출하여","x":304,"y":1200,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"실패하고,","x":455,"y":1200,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"각자의","x":610,"y":1201,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"락을","x":721,"y":1201,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"해제한","x":797,"y":1201,"width":96